    Bug 1955181 - Fix intermittent comm/calendar/test/browser/eventDialog/browser_utf8.js | "<U+01F4A3> <U+01F4A5> ☣ " == " <U+01F4A3> <U+01F4A5> ☣ ". r=tobyp


    Looks like the description wasn't quote finished loading... causing some side effect.
    With this change it passes with `--verify` but didn't before.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D243068

diff --git a/calendar/test/CalendarTestUtils.sys.mjs b/calendar/test/CalendarTestUtils.sys.mjs
